{"seq":2,"slug":"royalty-base-and-rate-model","title":"特许权使用费基数与费率模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/licensing-royalty-model/royalty-base-and-rate-model","wordCount":2813,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"特许权使用费基数与费率模型\">特许权使用费基数与费率模型</h1><p>一笔跨境许可合同在纸面上往往只写下一个数字——&quot;按净销售额的 5% 支付&quot;。但在海关估价里，这个数字必须被拆成两个能分别审计的变量：<strong>基数（royalty base）</strong> 与 <strong>费率（royalty rate）</strong>。同一笔 5% 的许可费，基数取&quot;毛销售额&quot;还是&quot;扣减后的净销售额&quot;、取&quot;全球销售额&quot;还是&quot;进口货物对应销售额&quot;，最终计入完税价格的金额可能相差数倍，进而放大关税与进口环节增值税。本文只解决一件事：把许可合同里的一个百分比，还原成海关可以计算、税务可以验证的结构 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = B \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-可计入性判定决定基数与费率的重要性\">核心概念：可计入性判定决定基数与费率的重要性</h2><p>特许权使用费并不总是要计入完税价格。判定链条由 WTO《海关估价协定》（《1994 年关税与贸易总协定》第七条实施协定）第 8.1(c) 条建立：与进口货物有关的特许权使用费和许可费，只要构成货物销售的条件、且未包含在实付或应付价格中，就应当加入成交价格（<a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/cusval_e/cusval_info_e.htm\">WTO Customs Valuation Agreement, Art. 8</a>）。世界海关组织（WCO）在其估价工具中把这条规则细化为判例法：<strong>Commentary 25.1</strong> 处理特许权使用费的一般处理原则，<strong>Case Studies 3.1–3.9</strong> 用商标、专利、技术诀窍、软件等多组实例说明什么情形构成&quot;销售条件&quot;（<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/valuation/instruments-and-tools.aspx\">WCO Valuation Instruments</a>）。</p>\n<p>判定链条可以画成一条决策路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[进口货物实付或应付价格] --&gt; B{存在特许权使用费?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| Z[不做调整]&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C{与进口货物有关?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| Z&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D{构成向境内销售的条件?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| Z&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E{是否已含在实付价格中?}&#10;    E --&gt;|已含| Z&#10;    E --&gt;|未含| F[计入完税价格]&#10;    F --&gt; G[确定基数 B]&#10;    G --&gt; H[确定费率 r]&#10;    H --&gt; I[应计入额 = B x r x 分摊系数]&#10;    I --&gt; J[完税价格扩大 -&gt; 关税与进口环节税基同步扩大]\">graph TD\n    A[进口货物实付或应付价格] --&gt; B{存在特许权使用费?}\n    B --&gt;|否| Z[不做调整]\n    B --&gt;|是| C{与进口货物有关?}\n    C --&gt;|否| Z\n    C --&gt;|是| D{构成向境内销售的条件?}\n    D --&gt;|否| Z\n    D --&gt;|是| E{是否已含在实付价格中?}\n    E --&gt;|已含| Z\n    E --&gt;|未含| F[计入完税价格]\n    F --&gt; G[确定基数 B]\n    G --&gt; H[确定费率 r]\n    H --&gt; I[应计入额 = B x r x 分摊系数]\n    I --&gt; J[完税价格扩大 -&gt; 关税与进口环节税基同步扩大]</pre><p>关键在最后两步：一旦判定为&quot;应计入&quot;，税负就由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 共同决定，而合同里的百分比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 只是其中一个乘数。<strong>基数口径的谈判价值，往往高于费率本身。</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基数口径</th>\n<th>定义要点</th>\n<th>对海关税基的典型影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>毛销售额（gross sales）</td>\n<td>不扣退货、折扣、税费</td>\n<td>基数最大，税负最高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>净销售额（net sales）</td>\n<td>扣退货、折扣、销售税、运费</td>\n<td>常见折中口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按件计费（per unit）</td>\n<td>每件固定金额</td>\n<td>与进口数量线性挂钩，易分摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保底额（minimum guarantee）</td>\n<td>无论销售，年度最低支付</td>\n<td>需按期间分摊到货物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次性买断（paid-up / lump sum）</td>\n<td>单笔支付覆盖全部期限</td>\n<td>需按货物价值占比分摊</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"主要法域的可计入性规则与差异\">主要法域的可计入性规则与差异</h2><p>四个法域的条文表述接近，但排除项与执行方式不同，直接改变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 的边界。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法域</th>\n<th>核心依据</th>\n<th>值得注意的排除项 / 特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WTO 框架</td>\n<td>估价协定 Art. 8.1(c)</td>\n<td>仅&quot;与进口货物有关 + 构成销售条件 + 未含在价格&quot;三者同时成立才加计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>《联盟海关法典》(UCC) 第 71 条，实施条例 (EU) 2015/2447 附件 23-01</td>\n<td>第 71(3)(a) 条明确：为在欧盟境内<strong>复制</strong>进口货物而支付的权利许可费不计入（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2013/952/oj\">Regulation (EU) No 952/2013</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>19 CFR 152.103(f)</td>\n<td>以&quot;条件销售（condition of sale）&quot;为核心；买方自有的技术援助、可分拆的售后服务费可排除（<a href=\"https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-19/chapter-I/part-152\">19 CFR 152.103</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>海关总署令第 213 号《审定进出口货物完税价格办法》</td>\n<td>第十一条将买方支付的特许权使用费列为应加计项，第十三条列举不计入情形（与进口货物无关、不构成向境内销售条件）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个容易被忽视的差异是<strong>复制权排除</strong>：欧盟成文排除了&quot;为在境内复制货物&quot;支付的许可费，而多数法域靠个案判断。软件、唱片、模具类进口在欧盟的结构设计与在美中两国并不相同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"基数建模-从毛销售额到分摊系数\">基数建模：从毛销售额到分摊系数</h2><p><strong>第一层选择是毛口径还是净口径。</strong> 合同若写&quot;按净销售额&quot;，必须把可扣减项逐条写清：退货、折让、账期折扣、运费与保险、增值税/销售税、以及第三方履约成本。海关关注的不是会计口径的&quot;净&quot;，而是<strong>这些扣减是否真实降低了与本批进口货物相关的对价</strong>。把增值税从基数中扣除通常被接受；把销售佣金一并扣除往往被质疑。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层选择是一次性买断与保底额的分摊。</strong> 许可证一次性支付 500 万元覆盖三年，不是把 500 万一次性计入某批货，而是按各期进口货物的价值占比分摊。设一次性许可费为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，总许可期限覆盖的全球相关销售为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，本批（本期）进口货物对应销售额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{batch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则分摊额为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>batch</mtext></msub><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{batch}} = L \\times \\frac{S_{\\text{batch}}}{S_{\\text{total}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">batch</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>同一逻辑用于保底额（MG）：年度保底 120 万元、当年进口对应销售占全年 25%，则本批分摊 30 万元。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层是当许可覆盖多个国家或多个产品线时的二次分摊。</strong> 若一份全球许可同时覆盖 A 国与 B 国销售、覆盖成品与配件，海关只接收&quot;进口到本关境货物&quot;对应的部分。通用做法是先按法域销售额分摊，再按产品线分摊：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>good</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>country</mtext></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>product</mtext></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>country</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{good}} = R_{\\text{total}} \\times \\frac{V_{\\text{country}}}{V_{\\text{total}}} \\times \\frac{V_{\\text{product}}}{V_{\\text{country}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">good</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">country</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">country</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">product</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一步是实践中最常被审计的环节，因为它需要企业同时提供<strong>分国销售额</strong>与<strong>分产品销售额</strong>两套可核对的数据，而不是只给一张集团合并报表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"费率建模-行业基准与阶梯结构\">费率建模：行业基准与阶梯结构</h2><p>费率不是拍脑袋定的，它被两条约束夹住：一条是<strong>行业可比区间</strong>，另一条是<strong>转让定价的独立交易原则</strong>。</p>\n<p>行业可比费率在实践中大量依赖许可交易数据库与行业协会调查，例如 ktMINE 的特许权使用费数据库与 LES（Licensing Executives Society）的年度调查。常见区间的经验印象是：品牌商标授权约 1%–5%（奢侈品、时尚更高）、专利授权约 2%–5%、软件与专有技术约 5%–10%、内容版权波动更大（<a href=\"https://www.ktmine.com/royalty-rates/\">ktMINE Royalty Rates</a>）。这些区间只能作为起点，不能作为结论——费率的合法性取决于可比交易的相似度，而非是否落在某个数字区间内。</p>\n<p>税率一旦确定，结构设计会显著改变现金流与分摊难度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>费率结构</th>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>适用与风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定费率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = r \\cdot S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最简单，易审计；忽视规模效应易被质疑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阶梯费率</td>\n<td>分段适用不同 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>体现量价关系；需明确定义分段口径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递减费率</td>\n<td>累计销售越高，边际费率越低</td>\n<td>常见于成长期产品；分摊计算复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>递增费率</td>\n<td>随销售上升而提高</td>\n<td>少见，多用于最低保证金结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封顶费率</td>\n<td>年度支付上限</td>\n<td>需说明封顶后剩余权利的归属</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>阶梯与递减结构的分摊额可用分段函数精确表达。设分段阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_0=0 &lt; T_1 &lt; \\dots &lt; T_n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，各段费率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，销售额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} r_i \\cdot \\min\\bigl(\\max(S - T_{i-1},\\ 0),\\ T_i - T_{i-1}\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个公式的价值在于：它让&quot;费率&quot;从合同里的一句话变成一串可复算的数，海关审定、税务稽查、内部审计三方可以用同一套输入得到同一结果。</p>\n<p>费率还须经得起转让定价的检验。OECD《跨国企业与税务机关转让定价指南》第六章要求关联交易中的无形资产回报与各方执行的 <strong>DEMPE</strong> 职能（开发、提升、维护、保护、利用）相匹配（<a href=\"https://www.oecd.org/tax/transfer-pricing/\">OECD TPG Chapter VI</a>）。实践中常被引用的&quot;25% 规则&quot;（许可费 = 相关营业利润的 25%）已被美国联邦巡回上诉法院在 <em>Uniloc USA, Inc. v. Microsoft Corp.</em>（632 F.3d 1292, 2011）中认定不可靠，不宜作为定价依据。WCO 与 OECD 联合发布的《海关估价与转让定价指南》给出六组案例，说明如何用转让定价文档中的可比分析支撑申报给海关的费率（<a href=\"https://www.wcoomd.org/en/topics/valuation/instruments-and-tools.aspx\">WCO Guide to Customs Valuation and Transfer Pricing</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从合同条款到申报动作-基数与费率如何落地\">从合同条款到申报动作：基数与费率如何落地</h2><p>海关口径与所得税口径对同一笔特许权使用费的处理方向常常相反：所得税希望费率<strong>可扣除、有独立交易依据</strong>；海关希望计入完税价格的金额<strong>完整、不遗漏</strong>。两者不矛盾，但需要一套共同的底层数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[签订许可合同] --&gt; B[识别许可标的: 商标/专利/技术诀窍/版权]&#10;    B --&gt; C[定义基数口径: 净销售额/件数/保底/买断]&#10;    C --&gt; D[定义费率结构: 固定/阶梯/递减/封顶]&#10;    D --&gt; E{许可费是否与进口货物挂钩?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[进口时预估金额并预申报]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[仅走所得税口径处理]&#10;    F --&gt; H[进口后按合同实际支付]&#10;    H --&gt; I[自支付之日起30日内向海关申报纳税]&#10;    I --&gt; J[与转让定价文档、总账分摊表对齐]\">flowchart TD\n    A[签订许可合同] --&gt; B[识别许可标的: 商标/专利/技术诀窍/版权]\n    B --&gt; C[定义基数口径: 净销售额/件数/保底/买断]\n    C --&gt; D[定义费率结构: 固定/阶梯/递减/封顶]\n    D --&gt; E{许可费是否与进口货物挂钩?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[进口时预估金额并预申报]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[仅走所得税口径处理]\n    F --&gt; H[进口后按合同实际支付]\n    H --&gt; I[自支付之日起30日内向海关申报纳税]\n    I --&gt; J[与转让定价文档、总账分摊表对齐]</pre><p>在中国，进口后支付、且应计入完税价格的特许权使用费，纳税义务人应自支付之日起 <strong>30 日内</strong> 向海关申报纳税，这一机制由海关总署公告 2019 年第 58 号确立（《关于特许权使用费申报纳税手续的公告》）。它把&quot;进口时一次性计入&quot;改造成&quot;支付后补申报&quot;，企业因此必须维护一张能同时回答两个问题的台账：<strong>这笔支付对应哪些进口报关单，以及按什么基数与费率分摊。</strong></p>\n<p>一个可复算的完整例子：某企业进口一批化妆品，报关单实付价格（不含许可费）折合人民币 100 万元；品牌商标许可按净销售额 5% 支付，该批货物在其境内对应净销售额为 400 万元。则特许权使用费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = 400 \\times 5\\% = 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 万元，计入后完税价格为 120 万元。若关税税率为 10%，仅关税就从 10 万元升至 12 万元；且进口环节增值税的计税基础同样包含关税，税基被二次放大。若合同中把基数从&quot;净销售额&quot;改成&quot;毛销售额&quot;（毛口径下对应 460 万元），则应计入的许可费变为 23 万元，完税价格 123 万元——<strong>同一句&quot;5%&quot;，税基差了 3 万元。</strong> 这正是基数口径必须写进合同、而非留给财务事后解释的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>海关估价中的特许权使用费必须拆成 <strong>基数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 与 <strong>费率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 两个独立变量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = B \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 才是可审计的结构。</li>\n<li>可计入性由三个条件共同决定：与进口货物有关、构成销售条件、未包含在实付价格中（WTO 协定第 8.1(c) 条）；欧盟另有复制权排除（UCC 第 71(3)(a) 条）。</li>\n<li>基数口径（毛/净/按件/保底/买断）的谈判价值常高于费率本身；一次性支付与保底额须按销售额占比分摊，多国多产品线许可要做二次分摊。</li>\n<li>费率须同时满足行业可比区间与转让定价独立交易原则；&quot;25% 规则&quot;已不可靠，应以 OECD 第六章的 DEMPE 分析支撑。</li>\n<li>落地动作的核心是一张跨口径台账：把每笔支付映射到具体报关单，中国情形下自支付起 30 日内向海关申报（海关总署公告 2019 年第 58 号）；本章导引见 <a href=\"./\">本章说明</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"特许权使用费基数与费率模型","id":"特许权使用费基数与费率模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：可计入性判定决定基数与费率的重要性","id":"核心概念-可计入性判定决定基数与费率的重要性"},{"level":2,"text":"主要法域的可计入性规则与差异","id":"主要法域的可计入性规则与差异"},{"level":2,"text":"基数建模：从毛销售额到分摊系数","id":"基数建模-从毛销售额到分摊系数"},{"level":2,"text":"费率建模：行业基准与阶梯结构","id":"费率建模-行业基准与阶梯结构"},{"level":2,"text":"从合同条款到申报动作：基数与费率如何落地","id":"从合同条款到申报动作-基数与费率如何落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"知识产权许可类型与权利边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/licensing-royalty-model/ip-license-type-rights-boundary"},"next":{"title":"许可合同关键条款与结构化建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-ip-licensing-royalty-customs/licensing-royalty-model/license-contract-terms-model"}}